{"id":"n14648-1-8","stage":3,"title":"꾸다 · 借","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14648-1-8-1","ko":"지수가 나한테 돈을 꿨는데 안 갚아.","zh":"智秀向我借钱，到现在还没还呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}},{"text":"나한테","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나한테","audio":"/audio/a650b718a38da6e97157.mp3"}},{"text":"돈을","meaning":"钱，钱款，价钱，费用","explanation":"돈：钱，钱款，价钱，费用；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"2","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈을","audio":"/audio/658b47180707ddf8eb38.mp3"}},{"text":"꿨는데","meaning":"借","explanation":"꾸다：借；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"꾸다","audio":"/audio/ea4054f32b1e1745e6a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14648","senseId":"1","lemma":"꾸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꿨는데","audio":"/audio/946a6a9c6174173956a1.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"갚아.","meaning":"还，偿还","explanation":"갚다：还，偿还；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"갚다","audio":"/audio/71bc1db964cf7285b77b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15728","senseId":"1","lemma":"갚다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갚아","audio"